<div align="center" class="default"><font face=arial size=4><b>WHAT IS THE ASCENSION GAMING NETWORK?</b></font></div>

<p align=justify>
AGN is a Network of Affiliated Websites geared towards the 18-34 year old market. We give you the connections and audience you seek with no effort on your part. Now that you don't have to worry about your "Page Views" you can do what you do best - Build Websites. 

<p align=justify>
<div align="center" class="default"><font face=arial size=4><b>WHAT WILL YOU DO FOR ME?</b></font></div>

<p align=justify>
<B>Exposure</B> - Your site will be given as much exposure as possible by AGN. Approximately 1,200,000 unique visitors each month, who may not otherwise know about your site but have interests similar to it, will now have access to you from any page on the network. Your interesting site happenings may even be announced across all of the network sites.

<p align=justify>
<b>Advertising Contracts</b> - We have special Profit sharing programs in place for targeted advertising across all of our affiliated sites. AGN has more leveraging power because of the diversity of the network as a whole. We in turn use that leveraging to generate more cash for your sites. Past advertisers targeting our network include Electronic Arts, Sony Online, Hasbro, Decipher, Google, Wizard's of the Coast and the list goes on and on.

<p align=justify>
<b>Run of Site Advertising</b> - Aside from targeted advertising deals, we allow our affiliates to reap the benefits of their own run of site advertising. The individual sites reap 100% of the profit accrued from this process and have complete freedom. We can provide extremely high paying run of site ads to affiliate sites if needed, but give our sites the choice to choose their own path.

<p align=justify>
<b>More Income?</b> - We have invested thousands of dollars into our Premium Service software. This software allows visitors of the network sites to block internet advertising and also to have access to advanced utilities and articles by top tier players and writers. Referring sites get a direct payment reimbursement for their sites visitors who purchase memberships.


<p align=justify>
<B>Dedication</B> - The Ascension team is dedicated to providing the best home for all of it's affiliate sites. We are also dedicated to expanding the AGN name and image. We have full time members as well as part time members that are available around the clock to help you make your site and AGN the best it can be.

