<p align=justify>
<B>Reliability</B> - From past experience, AGN has learned the importance of uptime. As such all servers are monitored and the admins will be paged if a server goes down. Remote reboot and control capabilities are available and full daily backups are made. Currently, AGN has all of our Hard Drives on a Mirror set-up, If one hard drive goes down the mirror will instantly jump in and replace it.



